"RESIDENTIAL TENANCY AGREEMENT
Made between Fictional Holdings LLC (Landlord) and LENA TESTOVA (Tenant).
Article I Premises
The premises are unit 1608 in Demo Marina Tower.
Article II Term and Rent
The term starts on 1 December 2026 and ends on 30 November 2027.
The annual rent is AED 135,000, paid in 4 cheques.
A security deposit of AED 6,750 is held.
Article III Signatures
Landlord
Tenant
Addendum
- Minor maintenance: The tenant pays for minor repairs up to AED 500 per item caused by ordinary use. The landlord
pays for structural repairs and for repairs to the building's main systems.
- Subletting: The tenant may not sublet the unit or any part of it without the landlord's written consent.
Article IV Additional terms required by law
The rent above is fixed for the whole term. It can only change at renewal, with written notice given in time under Dubai
law.
This contract is registered in Ejari after both parties sign.
Each party signs this contract electronically through a personal link. The signature record is added as the last page of the
signed copy.
